<section begin=intro />
'''Venom Dose''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Saryn}} that allows {{A|Spores}} to be held on cast, creating a wave of energy traveling outward from the user that temporarily grants the caster and nearby allies additional {{D|Corrosive}} damage to all attacks.
